### 파일 업로드: 휴가지각결근정책.docx
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/files?shared=true
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Authorization: {{Authorization}}

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="휴가지각결근정책.docx"

< ../samples/휴가지각결근정책.docx
--WebAppBoundary--

